OL,3,GNEWSAFour arrested over baby girl's
OL,4,Adeath in woodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fbaby was found dead while camping with
OL,8,Fher family in Staffordshire.
OL,10,FThe three-month-old girl died after
OL,11,Femergency services were called to
OL,12,Freports of a child in cardiac arrest in
OL,13,Fwoodland off Strawberry Lane, near
OL,14,FCheslyn Hay, at 08:45 BST on Saturday.
OL,16,FThis breaking news story is being
OL,17,Fupdated and more details will be
OL,18,Fpublished shortly. Please refresh the
OL,19,Fpage for the fullest version.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
